<p>You expend massive amounts of energy to launch yourself across <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 8</acronym> squares at incredible speed. All enemies in your path will be knocked flying and dealt between <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">72, 97, 116, 133, 147</acronym> and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">108, 145, 175, 199, 221</acronym> Physical damage.</p><p>At talent level 5, you can batter through solid walls.</p>